(7404035, 1165831, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I actually took photos of me like this for this challenge!   Ha!<br/> <br/>But, then I re-read the topic description: "Create a self portrait that includes your wheeled ride: car, truck, gator, golf cart, motorcycle, bicycle, wheelchair, hoveround, segway, scooter, skateboard, whatever."<br/> <br/>I un-submitted and couldn''t come up with anything else. <br/> <br/>Well... until early this morning when I came up with a brilliant idea!<br/> <br/>And then... I realized... that voting had started.  Ha!<br/> <br/>It''s probably a good thing that I didn''t enter.  Ha again!</td>', 'Ha!  I actually took photos of me like this for this challenge!   Ha! But, then I re-read the topic description: "Create a self portrait that includes your wheeled ride: car, truck, gator, golf cart, motorcycle, bicycle, wheelchair, hoveround, segway, scooter, skateboard, whatever." I un-submitted and couldn''t come up with anything else.  Well... until early this morning when I came up with a brilliant idea! And then... I realized... that voting had started.  Ha! It''s probably a good thing that I didn''t enter.  Ha again!', '2015-09-10 23:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
