(7404259, 1165945, 91496, '<td valign="top">Love the composition, with the layering.  The colors of the processing have an old film-like feel.  Wish there was some separation between you and the car.</td>', 'Love the composition, with the layering.  The colors of the processing have an old film-like feel.  Wish there was some separation between you and the car.', '2015-09-12 18:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7404260, 1166063, 91496, '<td valign="top">Yo Spiff!  Kudos for seeking a unique viewpoint.  The angle really makes your head small, which is a tough look for a portrait.  Not sure the negative space at the top works.</td>', 'Yo Spiff!  Kudos for seeking a unique viewpoint.  The angle really makes your head small, which is a tough look for a portrait.  Not sure the negative space at the top works.', '2015-09-12 18:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
